# Testing & Quality Assurance

## 🧪 Testing Strategy

### Testing Philosophy
- **Test-Driven Development**: Write tests before implementing features
- **Comprehensive Coverage**: Unit, integration, and end-to-end testing
- **Realistic Testing**: Use actual API responses and video processing
- **Performance Testing**: Monitor resource usage and processing times
- **Error Resilience**: Test failure scenarios and recovery

### Test Structure
```
backend/tests/
├── test_api.py              # API endpoint testing
├── test_enhanced_features.py # Enhanced features testing
├── test_models.py           # Data validation testing
├── test_video_processing.py # Video generation workflows
├── test_job_management.py   # Job queue and database
├── test_error_handling.py   # Error scenarios
└── fixtures/                # Test data and mock responses
    ├── sample_videos/
    ├── mock_responses/
    └── test_configs/
```

## 🔧 Backend Testing

